```
Primary:   #FF6B6B (Coral Red) - CTAs, stamps
Secondary: #4ECDC4 (Mint Teal) - Success, rewards
Tertiary:  #2C3E50 (Navy) - Text, trust
Warning:   #FFE66D (Soft Yellow)
