## Implementation Flow

1. Read relevant doc section
2. Check if schema exists in Prisma
3. Implement backend API first
4. Build Flutter UI from wireframe specs
5. Test manually

---

## Session Handoff

Start new sessions with:
> "Read .cursorrules and continue from where we left off."

