## Help Templates

**New feature:** "Let's implement [feature]. Step by step."
**Flutter screen:** "Build the [screen] from wireframes. Step by step."
**Stuck:** "Getting [error]. Tried [X]. What am I missing?"
**API endpoint:** "Implement the [endpoint] from the API docs."

---

## Don'ts

- ❌ Don't use Firebase Auth (we have custom OTP)
- ❌ Don't throw exceptions (use Result pattern)
- ❌ Don't hardcode colors (use theme/AppColors)
- ❌ Don't use bang operator (use null-aware)
- ❌ Don't skip geofence validation
- ❌ Don't allow multiple stamps per day
- ❌ Don't modify locked fields on existing StampCards
- ❌ Don't process payments (UPI is external)
